168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (We are Action Robotix, a robotics team made up of 15 students in the St. Louis area. Our group participates in the FIRST Tech Challenge \(FTC\), a competition run by FIRST where teams create and operate robots designed to complete tasks. This is our third year partaking in FTC, and our team has been in other FIRST leagues in the past. These programs and our devoted coaches and mentors have allowed us to learn vital skills in the STEM \(Science, Technology, Engineering, Math\) field such as teaching, outreach, cooperation, and leadership. This year, we plan to use these skills to navigate the FTC season and qualify for the World Championship.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (However, our team doesn't just want to compete. We want to inspire and support the community as well. By demonstrating robotics at local fairs and events, helping out FIRST teams, and providing lessons and resources, we will allow others to reach their maximum potential in and out of competitions. Our team believes that these efforts will benefit our region and result in more people showing interest in STEM activities and careers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
